comments.body:
[fix/issue-3475](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/issue-3475) is rebased onto today's `main` — head `1db7fb3df`, on `8abdf53a8`. The comment conflict with `99ad38b7` (Vertex) is resolved, both wordings kept; the code change is as before.

Tests re-run at the new head: `TestCopilotToolSearchBeta` red on clean `main` with only `betas.go` reverted, green at the head; neighbors (`TestBedrockBetas`, `TestUserBetas*`, `TestSignInBetaStaysWithMagpie`, `TestVertexClaudeModel`, `TestAutoModeReviewGoesWithItsBeta`) pass; `go vet` and `go build` (linux, windows, `-tags nogui`) clean.

@mdwsk88 thank you for the real-account verification and the impact analysis — the in-stream 400 after `message_start` failing the whole session is a much better case for the fix than the one-session 400 we had. The two patches are the same idea with the same rename in the same place; whichever one is easier to take is fine by us.

